      "summary": {
        "text": "Michael Jensen (born 5 February 1975) is a Danish racing driver who currently competes in the European Le Mans Series for Algarve Pro Racing.\n\nA long-term teammate of Nick Adcock, the pair won the 2023 Kyalami 9 Hours in NP02 and the 2024 European Le Mans Series in LMP3. Jensen then graduated to LMP2, and was crowned 2024–25 Asian Le Mans Series champion with Algarve Pro Racing.",
